<title>JAPAN: Advan says to repurchase its own shares.</title>
<headline>Advan says to repurchase its own shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advan Co Ltd said on Monday it would buy back up to 300,000 of its own shares, or up to 500 million yen worth.</p>
<p>Advan sells construction materials.</p>
</text>
